WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.767 --> 00:00:01.968
-Thank you so much

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:03.269
and welcome to
"The Tonight Show," everybody.

00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:04.871
Let's get to the news and jokes.

00:00:04.871 --> 00:00:08.174
Well, guys, a big story
just came out about something

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:11.811
the Trump administration
decided to do

00:00:11.811 --> 00:00:14.113
or really not to do about
the virus back in April.

00:00:14.113 --> 00:00:15.481
Watch this.

00:00:15.481 --> 00:00:17.683
-And there's new reporting
in "The Washington Post"

00:00:17.683 --> 00:00:20.119
that the administration
had a plan back in April

00:00:20.119 --> 00:00:24.457
to send 650 million masks
by mail,

00:00:24.457 --> 00:00:26.292
but the "Post" reports
the plan was scrapped

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:28.060
because there were fears
in the administration

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:30.997
it might cause a panic.
-Yeah.

00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:32.565
-When the news broke,
Trump was like, "See?

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:34.133
There was a plan.
I just blocked it."

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:35.534
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.534 --> 00:00:38.938
Yeah, Trump nixed the plan.
Even worse, it was after Don Jr.

00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:42.008
had already licked
200 million envelopes.

00:00:42.008 --> 00:00:46.746
"Are you kidding me?"
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:48.882
The worst part is,
when they told Trump the plan,

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:51.251
his first comment was
"Let's e-mail the masks.

00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:53.386
It'll be faster."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:55.621
"All right?
We'll look into that."

00:00:55.621 --> 00:00:59.225
That's right, Trump decided
he didn't want to create panic.

00:00:59.225 --> 00:01:01.193
Yeah, back in April,
I knew there wasn't a panic

00:01:01.193 --> 00:01:03.329
when I saw my neighbor
walk to the mailbox each day

00:01:03.329 --> 00:01:05.431
with a jockstrap over his face.

00:01:05.431 --> 00:01:08.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.902
And this is big -- the Trump
administration says that,

00:01:09.902 --> 00:01:12.238
starting this weekend,
they're banning TikTok

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:13.973
from The App Store.

00:01:13.973 --> 00:01:16.042
They had Commerce Secretary
Wilbur Ross

00:01:16.042 --> 00:01:18.410
make the announcement.
Let's see how that went.

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:22.148
-So, as to TikTok,
the only real change,

00:01:22.148 --> 00:01:27.387
as of Sunday night, will be --
won't have access

00:01:27.387 --> 00:01:32.859
to improved apps,
updated apps, upgraded apps,

00:01:32.859 --> 00:01:38.498
but the basic TikTok will stay
intact until November 12th.

00:01:38.498 --> 00:01:43.535
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.535 --> 00:01:45.571
-Man, if you hate your job,
think about the staffer

00:01:45.571 --> 00:01:47.707
who had to explain TikTok
to Wilbur Ross.

00:01:47.707 --> 00:01:49.041
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.041 --> 00:01:51.143
You see Maria Bartiromo
is just like...

00:01:51.143 --> 00:01:53.980
[ Exhales sharply ]
"What?"

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:55.648
Is he okay?
I mean, Wilbur Ross

00:01:55.648 --> 00:01:58.283
is what happens to your phone
when you ignore the updates.

00:01:58.283 --> 00:02:02.421
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:02.421 --> 00:02:03.622
Seriously, before today,

00:02:03.622 --> 00:02:05.792
Wilbur thought TikTok
was his pacemaker.

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:07.660
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:08.828
I'm pretty sure if you zoom out,

00:02:08.828 --> 00:02:11.097
you see Jeff Dunham's
hand up his back.

00:02:11.097 --> 00:02:14.901
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:17.203
Now, the government says
China is using TikTok

00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:19.272
to steal your data.
Yeah.

00:02:19.272 --> 00:02:21.541
America's like,
"We already gave it to Facebook,

00:02:21.541 --> 00:02:25.077
Instagram, Twitter, Alexa,
Apple Watch, Ring doorbell,

00:02:25.077 --> 00:02:27.179
the FaceSwap app.

00:02:27.179 --> 00:02:29.182
God.
We should've just done three.

00:02:29.182 --> 00:02:34.720
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:37.757
Is there anything else we need
to hear from Wilbur Ross?

00:02:37.757 --> 00:02:43.028
-In connection
with executive orders 13942

00:02:43.028 --> 00:02:50.436
and 13943, dealing respectively
with TikTok and WeChat.

00:02:50.436 --> 00:02:53.138
[ Coughing ]
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.138 --> 00:02:56.476
-What?!
[ Laughter continues ]

00:02:56.476 --> 00:03:01.113
-That was real?
-[ Laughing ] Yeah.

00:03:01.113 --> 00:03:02.582
I think the Postal Service

00:03:02.582 --> 00:03:04.350
should send half a billion masks
to him.

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:05.484
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.484 --> 00:03:07.486
In Wilbur's defense,
he would've coughed

00:03:07.486 --> 00:03:08.787
into his elbow,
but he didn't have have

00:03:08.787 --> 00:03:10.556
45 minutes to lift it.

00:03:10.556 --> 00:03:16.129
[ Laughter ]

00:03:16.129 --> 00:03:17.697
-Oof.

00:03:17.697 --> 00:03:21.067
[ Coughing ]

00:03:21.067 --> 00:03:23.001
-What was that?
I think he just coughed up

00:03:23.001 --> 00:03:26.572
a piece of taffy he ate
during the Civil War.

00:03:26.572 --> 00:03:28.007
Today, Trump's
Commerce Department

00:03:28.007 --> 00:03:29.742
issued an order saying
that new downloads

00:03:29.742 --> 00:03:31.610
of the TikTok app
will be banned in the U.S.

00:03:31.610 --> 00:03:32.878
starting this Sunday.

00:03:32.878 --> 00:03:34.713
-Wait.
Really?

00:03:34.713 --> 00:03:38.785
-I mean, TikTok might file
an injunction but, yeah.

00:03:38.785 --> 00:03:40.052
-Oh, man.

00:03:40.052 --> 00:03:43.590
Well, you want to have
one last "TikTok Talk"?

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:46.092
-Sure, Tariq.
Quest, can we get a beat?

00:03:46.092 --> 00:03:56.102
♪♪

00:03:56.102 --> 00:04:06.112
♪♪

00:04:06.112 --> 00:04:16.122
♪♪

00:04:16.122 --> 00:04:25.130
♪♪

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:27.433
-Nah. I'm good.

00:04:27.433 --> 00:04:36.408
♪♪

00:04:36.408 --> 00:04:40.145
-Last night, Trump held a
campaign rally in Wisconsin.

00:04:40.145 --> 00:04:42.547
At one point, he tried appealing
to dairy farmers

00:04:42.547 --> 00:04:44.016
by talking about milk,

00:04:44.016 --> 00:04:45.485
but I think he went
a little overboard.

00:04:45.485 --> 00:04:46.685
Watch this.

00:04:46.685 --> 00:04:48.787
-They have something called
specialty milk.

00:04:48.787 --> 00:04:53.926
It's a small little grouping
of milks -- specialty milk.

00:04:53.926 --> 00:04:56.929
And that really got me going,
the little specialty milk.

00:04:56.929 --> 00:05:02.468
But it was all because of
specialty milk.

00:05:02.468 --> 00:05:03.770
[ Laughter ]

00:05:03.770 --> 00:05:05.438
-If Trump had said "milk"
three more times,

00:05:05.438 --> 00:05:07.173
Mike Pence
would've suddenly appeared.

00:05:07.173 --> 00:05:08.508
[ Laughter ]

00:05:08.508 --> 00:05:10.008
Even dairy farmers are like,

00:05:10.008 --> 00:05:13.946
"What the hell is he
talking about, specialty milk?"

00:05:13.946 --> 00:05:15.848
Meanwhile, Joe Biden
is busy on the campaign trail.

00:05:15.848 --> 00:05:19.451
Last night, on CNN, he did an
outdoor drive-in town hall.

00:05:19.451 --> 00:05:20.686
It was pretty unique.

00:05:20.686 --> 00:05:22.555
People in the audience
sat on their car hoods.

00:05:22.555 --> 00:05:24.857
Here's what it looked like.

00:05:24.857 --> 00:05:26.993
Yeah, Trump was jealous.
He was like, "I'm gonna have

00:05:26.993 --> 00:05:31.964
a drive-in rally, but it'll
be indoors, engines on."

00:05:31.964 --> 00:05:34.400
[ Laughter ]

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:35.901
It was a good setting for Biden.

00:05:35.901 --> 00:05:37.469
Any time he was about
to mess up,

00:05:37.469 --> 00:05:39.638
his staffers
could just lay on the horn.

00:05:39.638 --> 00:05:41.807
"I miss the good ol' days
when you could call a guy --"

00:05:41.807 --> 00:05:43.142
[ Car horn blaring ]

00:05:43.142 --> 00:05:45.778
[ Laughter ]

00:05:45.778 --> 00:05:48.114
-Hey, I saw
that a new bronze statue

00:05:48.114 --> 00:05:51.951
of First Lady Melania Trump was
unveiled in Slovenia this week.

00:05:51.951 --> 00:05:53.352
Let's see how that turned out.

00:05:53.352 --> 00:05:56.856
♪♪

00:05:56.856 --> 00:06:03.829
[ Laughter ]

00:06:03.829 --> 00:06:05.898
-Wait.
-People were -- [ Laughs ]

00:06:05.898 --> 00:06:07.366
People were like,
"Wow, they captured

00:06:07.366 --> 00:06:09.468
her emotions perfectly."
[ Laughter ]

00:06:09.468 --> 00:06:11.304
-Is that real?
-It's real.

00:06:11.304 --> 00:06:12.805
-No.
-Yeah.

00:06:12.805 --> 00:06:15.808
[ Laughter ]

00:06:15.808 --> 00:06:17.443
You might not think
it's very realistic,

00:06:17.443 --> 00:06:19.812
but that statue has been
having dinner with Trump

00:06:19.812 --> 00:06:22.381
for the last six months.
[ Laughter ]

00:06:22.381 --> 00:06:24.283
"Well, you're chattier
than usual."

00:06:24.283 --> 00:06:27.586
[ Laughter ]

00:06:27.586 --> 00:06:29.855
And, finally, a dentist
in Alaska was just sentenced

00:06:29.855 --> 00:06:32.491
to prison for fraud
and malpractice.

00:06:32.491 --> 00:06:34.594
But there was one crime
he committed that stands out.

00:06:34.594 --> 00:06:35.894
Watch this.

00:06:35.894 --> 00:06:38.430
-A dentist who went viral for
riding a Hoverboard

00:06:38.430 --> 00:06:39.965
while pulling a patient's tooth

00:06:39.965 --> 00:06:42.668
has been sentenced
to 12 years in prison.

00:06:42.668 --> 00:06:44.103
[ Laughter ]

00:06:44.103 --> 00:06:46.438
-The dentist is furious
'cause the heart surgeon

00:06:46.438 --> 00:06:49.908
on the Segway only got 10 years.
[ Laughter ]

00:06:49.908 --> 00:06:51.410
The judge issued the sentence,
then said,

00:06:51.410 --> 00:06:53.413
"bailiff, glide him away."

